   "html": "<p>As Olivia hit the road on her first arena tour to support her sophomore release, IHEARTCOMIX created the GUTS World Tour Bus Experience to bring fans deeper into Olivia’s world and service everyone, even those unable to score a concert ticket. </p>\n<p>An ode to the iconic 90s mainstay of a teenage girl’s bedroom combined with a “backstage with Olivia” approach, fans were treated to a glimpse into her world, bursting with creatively curated decor and interactive, shareable encounters creative directed by <a href=\"https://www.mokibaby.com/\">MOKIBABY</a>.</p>\n<p>The crafty and colorful vehicle acted as a central hub and beacon for the tour, providing a one-of-a-kind experience complete with discoverable easter eggs, interactive activities, special offerings from brand partners, and a chance to receive exclusive giveaways.</p>"
  }
 ],
