  {
   "title": "BUS CREATIVE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>The refurbished school bus was adorned in a custom vinyl wrap that took design cues from the GUTS World Tour poster and creative ad materials, allowing guests to have multiple photo moments throughout the experience. Guests entered the bus through starry curtains, symbolizing a crossover into Olivia’s new world, filled with Olivia’s signature purple alongside endless stars. Guests could pose for photos on the giant crescent moon bench, similar to the one she sits on during her concert performance, and all attendees had the opportunity to recreate Olivia’s tour poster themselves by posing with the GUTS toilet.</p>",
     "right": "<p>In the bus, sat a lips phone where guests could pick up the receiver and listen to Olivia’s voice prompt them to leave her a personal message. Olivia’s closet displayed actual outfits she wore during her SOUR world tour, as well as photos and snapshots from the iconic tour. Custom build 3D GUTS candles sat above the bus exit, next to a polaroid installation and a knives outline guests could pose between before leaving, as a nod to her “get him back” music video.</p>"
    },
