  {
   "title": "PARTNER INTEGRATION",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Presenting partner <strong>American Express</strong>, along with <strong>Sony Linkbuds S</strong>, and <strong>Dr. Martens</strong> had a dedicated presence onsite that offered multiple opportunities to further engage fans with both Olivia’s world and their brands. As an incentive for either showing proof of being an existing AMEX card holder or providing their email information onsite, fans received an exclusive pack of (3) Olivia Rodrigo x AMEX trading cards. When activating on show days, all eligible attendees were invited to apply for 2 free tickets to that evening’s concert.</p>",
     "right": "<p>At the dedicated merch booth, Amex card members were able to purchase an exclusive Olivia Rodrigo t-shirt with their card. Fans could also purchase and try out the LinkBuds S x Olivia Rodrigo earbuds inside the bus and at the merch booth. Lastly, fans who came rocking their favorite Doc Martens shoes could deck them out at our customization station using Olivia-inspired charms and laces.</p>"
    },
