  {
   "title": "ADDITIONAL ACTIVITIES",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>At the merch customization station, we equipped guests with all tools and supplies to customize their recently purchased product. Custom “tour” stickers decorated the road case style tables guests worked on top of where fans customized over 2,300+ items! </p>",
     "right": "<p>Guests could also grab and fill out exclusive postcards with a custom message to a fellow Livie! Lastly, a dedicated kiosk allowed fans to capture the moment and take branded selfies with their friends and post on socials; nearly 6,000 photos were taken!</p>"
